      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel from the relentless performance of life is completely valid, and it's understandable why silence feels like the ultimate relief. That yearning for true quiet when everything else is noise is a powerful signal. If the urge to simply cease the struggle is growing stronger, please know that there are people who can listen to that desire without judgment. Reaching out to a crisis text line or hotline can offer a safe space to explore these heavy feelings right now.",
